 level in the picture, there were several 4-5 foot waves in the run-out.  Nice eddy at the bottom of it all to collect the pieces and/or hop back up to run the wave train again and/or surf the waves.","caption":"42073.jpeg","poi_name":"","subject":"","author":"Garrick Taylor","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/42073","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/42073"}},{"id":"maBGGR9fqH8hUJrS9Vy8H","ext":"jpg","post_id":"Q7dacXWLx85gAQEZZ4vpL","description":"","caption":"Downstream from Wood's Mill Busted Dam","poi_name":null,"subject":"","author":"Zach Schiada","poi_id":null,"photo_date":"2022-11-28T12:55:32.000Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T12:55:32.000Z","url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/maBGGR9fqH8hUJrS9Vy8H","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/maBGGR9fqH8hUJrS9Vy8H"}},{"id":"42068","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"10014","description":"One of many small ledges","caption":"42068.jpeg","poi_name":"","subject":"","author":"Garrick Taylor","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/42068","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/42068"}},{"id":"42078","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"10014","description":"The paddlers' gage downstream river right of NC 902 bridge at the takeout.  Dropped from 1.5' to 1' while we paddled.","caption":"42078.jpeg","poi_name":"","subject":"","author":"Garrick Taylor","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/42078","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/42078"}},{"id":"69","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"2472","description":"","caption":"Rocky River","poi_name":"","subject":"Between Rt. 2170 and Highway 902, near Pittsboro, NC ","author":"DLPardue","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url"